      ],
      "title": "故国旧梦·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21401001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办乙",
          "text": "大人，家督大人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "去而复返，终究还是难以摆脱我「梵天丸」的charm吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办甲",
          "text": "地头蛇，是地头蛇，他们说今天一定要把大家驱赶出境！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办丙",
          "text": "不是一直喊着要打架吗，人已经闯上门来了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "地头霸烈猫",
          "text": "里面的鼠辈，从老子的地盘里滚出来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "地头喽啰盒",
          "text": "鼠辈，滚出来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "地头霸烈猫",
          "text": "今天，是你们在这里苟且偷生的最后一天，不想吃拳头，就乖乖夹着尾巴搬出去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "地头喽啰盒",
          "text": "最后一天，搬出去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Well done，来得正好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸣太郎",
          "text": "前，前面那个是街区一霸……人称「霹雳黑风霸烈猫」，听，听说他……非常能打。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "No worry，小菜一碟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "独眼龙，my soldier，我的后背就交给你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独眼龙",
          "text": "放心老大，我会把他们的小脑瓜统统敲烂！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "现在，Let's Party！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独眼龙",
          "text": "欧拉欧拉欧拉——阿打打打打打——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办乙",
          "text": "欸？这段话……好像在哪听过？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办甲",
          "text": "我知道，是《川中岛乱入》！今天刚演过的段落！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办丙",
          "text": "呵，每天沉迷排剧的家伙，谁知道能不能行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "地头霸烈猫",
          "text": "哼，罩着这群流民的，就是你这瘦胳膊细腿的家伙吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "地头喽啰盒",
          "text": "流民，就是你这家伙吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Right，在下伊达政宗，乃一家之督，守护领地内的子民是职责所在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "地头霸烈猫",
          "text": "呸，满嘴鸟语的小白脸，待会儿可别哭出来，看拳——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21401023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "地头喽啰盒",
          "text": "小白脸，看拳——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-438",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "yidazhengzong",
          "rowIds": [
            21401001,
