    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21403001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "这位就是负责「手办安居计划」的阿尔弗雷德大人了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "咳，无家可归的居民们，尊贵的阿尔弗雷德大人现在正式宣布，这片豪宅就是你们的永久居所了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办甲",
          "text": "哇！真，真是太好了！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办丙",
          "text": "出手阔绰，雷厉风行，这才是可靠男人该有的样子嘛~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办乙",
          "text": "我不是在做梦吧？唔，痛痛痛……竟然是真的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈，崇拜我吧，伟大的阿尔弗雷德无所不能！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办丙",
          "text": "让开——哎，真田君，你也住在这附近吗？平时有什么爱好呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办甲",
          "text": "等一等，真田君，你喜欢什么口味的涂料呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办乙",
          "text": "真田君，平时……喜欢睡觉吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "喂，你们……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Surprise，被无视了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独眼龙",
          "text": "你倒是一点都不担心呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Why，真田君受欢迎，我很开心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸣太郎",
          "text": "大，大家都跟着叫真田的家伙走了……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办丙",
          "text": "抱歉，你就在这里做自己的家督大梦吧，我们决定追随真正可靠的少城主大人了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "流浪手办甲",
          "text": "虽然我也很崇敬家督大人您的，对不起！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "阿……都走掉了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸣太郎",
          "text": "……是，都走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Anything goes，这真是，唉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独眼龙",
          "text": "事实上，我也要走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Pardon，你说什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独眼龙",
          "text": "我说——我受够了！我受够了在你这个鸟不拉屎的地方演老掉牙的历史剧！没有架打！每天搬家！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸣太郎",
          "text": "……我，我也，受够了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Wait，等等。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独眼龙",
          "text": "不要妄想得到安慰了，我已经下定决心了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21403026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸣太郎",
          "text": "……对，总之就，就是这样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-440",
